Z||000004||Monkeyman||09-19-2001||07:49 PM||||I'm assuming it's not a fastback which would eliminate it being an '88 (only aero fascia in '88 was the GT).  If it has the stock steering wheel, it must be either an '86 or '87 SE (you said horn button<B>s</B>).  If the body is in decent shape, I'd say $500 max (but I'm cheap).||||reg||1
